        {
            "title": "志聖慶一甲子家庭日逾800人同歡　加發4000萬元獎金感謝同仁",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6a613d0defe1db7174182b9a534b8ba29f6bd92a8045b14bcd9938101d9867fd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F6045dee682f8a97077c817c30a13ed28.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure></div>",
